// Designed, not tested. Virtual WAN gateway diagnostic logs, sent to a Log Analytics workspace by a diagnostic setting.
// Category names, table names and column names depend on the destination mode (AzureDiagnostics or resource-specific tables);
// check current Microsoft docs. Route tables themselves have no log: use effective routes for routing questions.

// Tunnel state changes on the hub VPN gateway
AzureDiagnostics
| where Category == "TunnelDiagnosticLog"
| where TimeGenerated > ago(2h)
| project TimeGenerated, Resource, remoteIP_s, status_s, stateChangeReason_s
| order by TimeGenerated desc

// BGP route changes seen by the hub VPN gateway: what was learned from the branch
AzureDiagnostics
| where Category == "RouteDiagnosticLog"
| where TimeGenerated > ago(2h)
| project TimeGenerated, Resource, prefix_s, nextHop_s, asPath_s, operation_s
| order by TimeGenerated desc

// IKE negotiation problems
AzureDiagnostics
| where Category == "IKEDiagnosticLog"
| where TimeGenerated > ago(2h)
| project TimeGenerated, Resource, Message
| order by TimeGenerated desc

// Metric names worth charting on the hub (check the exact names in the portal): BGP peer status,
// BGP routes advertised and learned, tunnel ingress and egress bytes, gateway scale-unit utilisation.
